{"unit_id":"tag:02YL:title","translation":"态射（morphisms）在目标（target）上关于 fppf 拓扑（topology）为局部（local）的性质","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究的概形态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"态射性质局部性所在的目标；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质在目标上的局部性；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02YL:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出概形（schemes）态射（morphisms）的一些性质，我们尚未能证明它们在底（base）上关于 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）为局部（local）的，然而它们在底（base）上关于 fppf 拓扑（topology）为局部（local）的。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"本节态射的几何对象；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究的态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底","context":"检验态射性质局部性的底；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑","context":"尚未证明某些性质为局部的拓扑；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"态射性质的局部性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"已能证明这些性质为局部的fppf拓扑；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02YM:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是浸入（immersion）”在底（base）上关于 fppf 为局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"本引理断言可在fppf底覆盖上检验的态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底","context":"性质局部性所在的底；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"关于fppf的局部性；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02YM:proof","translation":"为浸入（immersion）的性质在基变换（base change）下稳定，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。为浸入（immersion）的性质在底（base）上关于 Zariski 为局部（local）的。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）态射（morphism），且是平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的。由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>知<MATH_0002>是开（open）的。设<MATH_0003>是态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>是浸入（immersion）。特别地，<MATH_0005>是局部闭（locally closed）的。因此，由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0003>知<MATH_0006>是局部闭（locally closed）的。令<MATH_0007>为闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0008>。再次由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0004>知<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中是闭（closed）的。因此，可以对 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）<MATH_0011>应用引理<REF_0005>，得到<MATH_0012>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。换言之，<MATH_0013>是浸入（immersion）。因此，引理<REF_0006>适用，所需结论成立。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"沿覆盖下降的性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"浸入的稳定性及给定态射的基变换；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底","context":"局部性所在的底；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"Zariski局部性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"覆盖态射两端的概形；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"覆盖态射的性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖和待检验的态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"fppf覆盖的平坦性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"覆盖态射的有限表示条件；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"覆盖态射是开映射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭","context":"态射像的拓扑性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集","context":"像的闭包去掉像所得的闭子集；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭","context":"像在所取补集中为闭；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"去掉闭子集后的覆盖；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"在补集上的下降结论；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0H8J:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是支配（dominant）的”在底（base）上关于 fppf 为局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配","context":"态射像稠密的性质，暂译支配；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底","context":"局部性所在的底；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"关于fppf的局部性；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0H8J:proof","translation":"由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>，支配（dominant）态射（morphisms）沿开（open）态射（morphisms）的拉回（pullback）仍为支配，因而沿平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的态射（morphisms）的拉回也仍为支配（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>）。另一个方向更容易。事实上，支配（dominant）这一性质显然在底（base）上关于 Zariski 为局部（local）的。接着，设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的满射（surjective）态射（morphism）（不必平坦（flat），也不必局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）），并设<MATH_0002>是态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是支配（dominant）的。则<MATH_0004>是两个支配（dominant）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition），因而是支配（dominant）的。由于这也是复合（composition）<MATH_0005>，可知<MATH_0006>是支配（dominant）的。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配","context":"态射像稠密的性质，暂译支配；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"支配、开或平坦态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"拉回所沿态射的开性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"沿开态射的基变换；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"用于拉回和所给满射态射的条件；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"平坦态射成为开态射的条件；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底","context":"Zariski局部性所在的底；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"支配性质的Zariski局部性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"满射态射两端的几何对象；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"另一方向所需的覆盖条件；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所给覆盖及待检验的态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"在满射态射上的基变换；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"证明末尾比较的两种态射复合；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
