{"unit_id":"tag:02LB:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面的引理看起来或许有些无足轻重，但它是研究平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）及非分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）的一个有用工具。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"本引理用于研究的态射类型；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"本引理用于研究的另一态射类型；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"平展和非分歧态射；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06NC:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是平坦（flat）、拟紧（quasi-compact）、满射（surjective）的单态射（monomorphism）。则 f 是同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":["f"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"所给单态射的平坦性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"所给单态射的拟紧性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"所给单态射的满射性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"引理所研究的态射类型；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"引理的结论；词表未批准。"}],"notes":["原文第二句的变量f在数学模式外；忠实保留该字样，不改写锁定原文。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06NC:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>是平坦（flat）、拟紧（quasi-compact）、满射（surjective）的态射（morphism），<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。对角（diagonal）<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism）（《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>）。这意味着<MATH_0005>沿<MATH_0006>的基变换（base change）是同构（isomorphism）。因此，由引理<REF_0002>知<MATH_0007>是同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"给定态射的平坦性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"给定态射的拟紧性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"给定态射的满射性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定的态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"由给定态射形成的覆盖；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"单态射对应的对角态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"对角、基变换及原态射的性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"态射沿自身的基变换；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
